    {
      "id": "claim_500ea4007b4e4a9aaee2b504b668c323",
      "statement": "Peer connections are configured with a single STUN URL only (default stun:stun.l.google.com:19302, selectable from a built-in list, overridable via the 'i' URL param, which the receive side accepts only when in the STUN_SERVERS allowlist); no TURN server or fallback is configured.",
